    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "79a2f295-5c40-5da2-848c-3cad07f686ee",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 1 & 0 & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $AB=BA={I}_{3}$\n\n- **II.** $BC=CB={I}_{3}$\n\n- **III.** $A={B}^{-1}$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{3}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\u2217 & \u2217 & \u2217 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217 & -1 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217 & \u2217\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{3}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false. As a result, $A\\ne {B}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $BC=CB={I}_{3}.$ Computing $BC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BC & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 1 & 0 & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{3}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 1 & 0 & -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{3}.\\,\u2713\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "55a03ab0-6880-5b00-bdef-0f1e31103174",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
